{"title": "Dreamlike Aura: Lightning", "pageid": 50319, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Dreamlike_Aura:_Lightning", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Dreamlike Aura: Lightning</b> is a passive feature exclusive to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Hallucination\" title=\"Lightning Hallucination\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png/38px-Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png/50px-Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Hallucination\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/06/Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png/25px-Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/06/Portrait_Lightning_Hallucination.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Hallucination\" title=\"Lightning Hallucination\">Lightning Hallucinations</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Staying close to this creature grants <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Lightning_Resistance_Aura\"> Condition: Lightning Resistance Aura </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Resistance_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Resistance Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning Resistance Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Generic_Lightning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Resistance_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Lightning Resistance Aura (Condition)\">Lightning Resistance Aura</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>The fantastical powers of this hallucinatory imp give all nearby creatures <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning_Hallucination\" title=\"Lightning Hallucination\">Lightning Hallucination</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714215504\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.041 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1298/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12107/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4158/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 172/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639895/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--